'''Red Traveler's Axe''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to players that finished Top 100 in the [[Halloween Event 2023]] Leaderboard. 

==Appearance==
It looks exactly like [[Traveler's Axe]], but with a dark-red texture instead of the regular texture.

==Trivia==
*Other variants of this include [[Gold Traveler's Axe]], [[Silver Traveler's Axe]], and [[Bronze Traveler's Axe]].
*This item is a red reskin of the [[Ancient Weapons|godly]] knife [[Traveler's Axe]].
*Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*On November 22nd, [[Nikilis]] wiped many exploiters off the leaderboard, resulting in those just under the Top 100 getting on the leaderboard and receiving this prize.

